      "literal_source_text": "Assume \\beta\\eta\\leq 1 β ​ η ≤ 1 \\beta\\eta\\leq 1 , and set \\rho_{\\rm mac}\\coloneqq\\frac{1-\\alpha\\eta}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\coloneqq\\sqrt{1-\\rho_{\\rm mac}^{2}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,. ρ mac ≔ 1 − α ​ η 1 + α ​ η , γ gap ≔ 1 − ρ mac 2 = 2 ​ α ​ η 1 + α ​ η . \\rho_{\\rm mac}\\coloneqq\\frac{1-\\alpha\\eta}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\coloneqq\\sqrt{1-\\rho_{\\rm mac}^{2}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,. (B.12) Note that \\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\geq\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta} γ gap ≥ 1 2 ​ α ​ η \\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\geq\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta} . Then the following hold."
